===Etymology===
{{ety|en|:univ|all|right|tree=1|text=+}} Compare {{cog|ang|eallriht||all-right, just, exactly}} (from {{compound|ang|eall|riht|nocat=1}}), equivalent to {{prefix|en|al-#Etymology_1|t1=all|right}}.

